h-largest country in Europe by area. Sofia is the nation's capital and largest city; other major cities include Plovdiv, Varna, and Burgas.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bulgaria","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"BG"}],"arc":{"reports":39,"first_seen":"2026-10-11T07:35:49Z","first_title":"Drones hit Black Sea ships, Bulgaria says","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQX0wwLW9VQkZuREJoWVFzendnNTdLNW8xV01EZ3JrSnRzUW9LVldRZ05rNnVhWmNBb2JIMXgyZVJnb3RvNjc4VDFuVFBDSVpJcm51bV95Q2tGampnUklGWTMxbHhGQ1ZrMjMwQkZ0QU5SZ09ONDF0NTI2T0lUMGhyaXFIVk5RZHRGVVFCQnlJd1Vfd1dp?oc=5","first_publisher":"БНР Новини","earlier":[{"id":"e_c1da3045c264","title":"NATO to address drone attacks in the Black Sea after seven missing off Romania","date":"2026-10-15T13:35:22Z","url":"https://www.france24.com/en/seven-missing-off-romania-after-latest-black-sea-drone-attacks","publisher":"France 24 — English","verification":"multi_source_reporting"},{"id":"e_5014645202e2","title":"NATO chief discusses Black Sea security with Bulgarian, Romanian leaders after drone attacks on ships","date":"2026-10-15T14:36:23Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"Anadolu Ajansı","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_bc09087424f2","title":"Black Sea ship attacks prompt NATO security talks with Bulgaria, Romania","date":"2026-10-15T14:51:55Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQSDcxdEk5MVl1Nk5Kc0JhVXVfNlZwSGxaaXM5WjdyaTY1VGx3R1d5R2RTdnRMR3BlUko2R0JsbGhsQmZndWMyVmxyTHhMNkhUdUtGN2UxR1VTQVoxSjd3SlFTdFZrbzJQLXhtOXVRdjJuUkpFamtTQkdmbms2OFpIRVlkN2FBMjhZY04zZ1pNMHk1ZXR1dkFv?oc=5","publisher":"Latest news from Azerbaijan","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_d5cad878875c","title":"Black Sea grain war escalates: Ukraine knocked out most of Russia’s grain exports, and Russia is now sinking ships off Romania and Bulgaria","date":"2026-10-15T22:26:01Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5IbWI3eVlXcnpwM